			"date": "2021-08-01T10:03:11.000Z",
			"content": "Been toying with a variable font (Work Sans) and CSS yesterday for the first time.\n\nInteresting reads on that topic for conversion, optimization and fallbacks management:\n- <a href=\"http://clagnut.com/blog/2390\">clagnut.com/blog/2390</a>\n- <a href=\"https://www.sarasoueidan.com/blog/glyphhanger\">sarasoueidan.com/blog/glyphhang…</a>\n- <a href=\"https://henry.codes/writing/how-to-convert-variable-ttf-font-files-to-woff2\">henry.codes/writing/how-to…</a>\n- <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/glyphhanger\">zachleat.com/web/glyphhanger</a>\n\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://henry.codes/writing/how-to-convert-variable-ttf-font-files-to-woff2/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.sarasoueidan.com/blog/glyphhanger/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/glyphhanger/\"></a>",
