			"content": "TIL a very nice font performance improvement called subsetting ⚡️ Checkout <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/glyphhanger/\">zachleat.com/web/glyphhange…</a> by <a href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\">@zachleat</a> Cut down a variable font I wanted to use from 256kb to 38kb! 💪",
