				"url": "https://twitter.com/peruvianidol",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/634afa59eff185624485098b7a75d834d835b02b24c8b58db7770f3416d4baf9.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2022-09-05T14:44:27.000Z",
			"content": "They’re a little over 40k each. The biggest thing is to preload them: <a href=\"https://web.dev/codelab-preload-web-fonts/\">web.dev/codelab-preloa…</a>\n\nI don't recall having to do much to get Glyphhanger working (trust me, I am useless with CLIs). This post from <a href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\">@zachleat</a> made it pretty straightforward. <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/glyphhanger/\">zachleat.com/web/glyphhange…</a>\n\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/KatieLangerman\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 1511616,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/KatieLangerman/status/1566801413287469056",
			"author": {
				"name": "Katie Langerman",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/KatieLangerman",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/77758ed88cb335e9c5ccdc59d7d179d0d96141db538a6a4fe2259b4f42a2c829.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2022-09-05T14:52:21.000Z",
			"content": "I'm wondering if maybe my font files aren't caching. I inlined the CSS font declarations in a style tag <a href=\"https://github.com/langermank/ux-at-your-leisure-podcast/blob/main/src/_includes/layouts/base.njk#L14\">github.com/langermank/ux-…</a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/peruvianidol\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://web.dev/codelab-preload-web-fonts/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.11ty.recipes/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.mikeaparicio.com/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/glyphhanger/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 1511615,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/peruvianidol/status/1566801685602762752",
