			},
			"date": "2022-09-05T14:53:26.000Z",
			"content": "It's the site live? I could take a look. Maybe there are other gains to be had elsewhere. Feel free to DM me if you're not comfortable sharing the link publicly.\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/KatieLangerman\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://web.dev/codelab-preload-web-fonts/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/glyphhanger/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
