		},
		{
			"id": 1512570,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat/status/1567146835231346691",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/d9711a9ad30ae05a761e4a728883bcbdd852cbf7d41437925b0afc47a8589795.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2022-09-06T13:44:56.000Z",
			"content": "the tricky thing about font loading is that your font files are too slow and the rest of your site is too fast 😅 You’re racing first render on 6.1 kB or HTML/CSS against 71.4 kB of fonts\n\nI think your options are: 1. subset and preload the subset 2. make your site slower 😅\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/KatieLangerman\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/peruvianidol\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://web.dev/codelab-preload-web-fonts/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.11ty.recipes/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.mikeaparicio.com/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/glyphhanger/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 1753865,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://calendar.perfplanet.com/2023/ten-optimisation-tips-for-an-initial-web-performance-audit/",
			"author": {},
			"date": "2023-12-15T03:58:34.000Z",
